---
import Icons from "./Icons.astro";
import { SITE } from "../data/site";

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white">
  <div class="container-page py-12">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="flex flex-col leading-tight">
          <span class="text-base font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-black">
            {SITE.name}
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electricBlue">
            Executive Brand Strategist
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
          Brand strategy, media IP education, and athletic performance ecosystems across the Gulf
          Coast.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-400">
          Legal safeguards
        </h3>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2">
          <a href="/resources/" class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-electricBlue transition hover:text-black">
            Free resources
          </a>
          <a href="/faq.html" class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-electricBlue transition hover:text-black">
            FAQ
          </a>
          <a href="/privacy.html" class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-electricBlue transition hover:text-black">
            Privacy
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-400">Connect</h3>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaylen-sinegal"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="LinkedIn profile"
            class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-neutral-300 text-neutral-600 transition hover:border-electricBlue hover:text-electricBlue hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(37,99,235,0.4)]"
          >
            <Icons name="linkedin" />
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500">Lafayette · Youngsville · Louisiana</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-6 text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-500">
      <p>
        <strong class="font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-600">Regulatory &amp; Professional Status:</strong>
        Jaylen Sinegal is an Executive Brand Strategist and Media IP Consultant. He is not an attorney
        and does not provide legal advice. Jaylen Sinegal is not a licensed athlete agent under
        Louisiana Senate Bill 389 (Act 895) and does not solicit, negotiate, or procure athletic
        contracts, professional tryouts, or commercial endorsement agreements. All consultations,
        workshops, and written materials are provided strictly for educational, informational, and
        brand architecture purposes.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong class="font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-600">Institutional &amp; State Recognition Disclosure:</strong>
        References to &ldquo;Official Louisiana Storyteller&rdquo; reflect an individual civic and
        cultural recognition by Louisiana Economic Development (LED) and do not constitute an official
        state agency endorsement, sponsorship, or public regulatory function. Sinegal Media &amp; Brand
        Architecture LLC is an independent, privately owned commercial consulting practice.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong class="font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-600">Data Privacy &amp; Ethical AI Standards:</strong>
        In alignment with Louisiana Division of Administration (DOA) / Office of Technology Services
        (OTS) standards and federal privacy regulations (COPPA), this practice never inputs
        student-athlete personal data, academic records, or biometric information into public, unvetted
        generative AI systems. All diagnostic evaluations, brand roadmaps, and combine analytics are
        conducted and reviewed with strict human-in-the-loop oversight.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong class="font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-600">Minor NIL &amp; Amateurism Protection:</strong>
        All minor student-athlete engagements require verifiable parental or legal guardian consent in
        accordance with Louisiana Act 810. Advisory services strictly exclude all prohibited vice
        categories (sports wagering, alcohol, tobacco/vaping, cannabis, adult entertainment) and enforce
        LHSAA Rule 1.14 amateur status preservation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500">
        © {year} Sinegal Media &amp; Brand Architecture LLC. Registered Office: 9020 Red Rose Lane,
        Abbeville, LA 70510. All rights reserved.
      </p>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500">
        <Icons name="zap" className="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-electricBlue" />
        Strategy · Education · Compliance
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>